Package: tundraux3
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: TundraUX3 contributors <maintainers@tundraux3.invalid>
Depends: xdg-utils, libglib2.0-bin, libc-bin
Recommends: dbus-user-session, xdg-desktop-portal, policykit-1, xwayland
Description: Terminal desktop environment experiment
 TundraUX3 provides a full-screen terminal shell and its management CLI.
 Ordinary-user Linux operation is supported; Debian system package updates are
 managed externally and are not provided by the Fedora update frontend.
